# ── WalletConnect ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get a free Project ID at https://cloud.walletconnect.com
# This is a public app identifier — NOT a secret. Safe to commit if you wish.
VITE_WC_PROJECT_ID=your_walletconnect_project_id_here

# ── RPC ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Public BSC nodes (no key required). Replace with a private node for production.
VITE_BSC_RPC_URL=https://bsc-dataseed1.binance.org/

# ── Backend (Daily Strategy bot) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# DailyTrades is fed by a separate service:
#   https://github.com/simeonite13/bnb_trading_bot  (private)
# In dev, vite proxies /bnb_wallet_app/api/bot/* → http://127.0.0.1:8055.
# No env var is needed here — the proxy path is wired in vite.config.ts.
# To run the backend locally:  systemctl --user start bnb-api.service
# On the production deploy (GitHub Pages) there is no backend reachable, so
# the DailyTrades card will show a network error.

# ── SECURITY NOTE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This app NEVER asks for, stores, or transmits your private key or seed phrase.
# WalletConnect only — connection is read-only by design.
